{
  "name": "Planar Recovery",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have learned to regain some of your magical energy by drawning from the essence of the planes. Once per Long Rest when you finish a Short Rest, you can choose expended spell slots to recover. The spell slots can have a combined level that is equal to or less than half your summoner level (rounded up), and none of the slots can be 3rd level or higher.</p><p>For example, if you're a 4th-level summoner, you can recover up to two levels worth of spell slots.</p><p>You can recover either a 2nd-level spell slot or two 1st-level spell slots.</p>",
